{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "11.0.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "prometheus", "name": "Prometheus", "version": "1.0.0" }
  ],
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "System-level overview: Nginx connections, PostgreSQL activity, Go API in-flight requests. Phase 2 will add /proc-based CPU/mem/disk panels.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": [],
      "title": "App Performance →",
      "tooltip": "Switch to App Performance dashboard",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/perf-app/app-performance"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "title": "🌐 Nginx — Connection & Request Metrics",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Active Nginx Connections",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nginx_connections_active",
          "legendFormat": "Active",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 9, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "Nginx Request Rate (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "rate(nginx_http_requests_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Requests/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 9, "x": 15, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "Nginx Connections by State",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nginx_connections_active",
          "legendFormat": "Active",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nginx_connections_waiting",
          "legendFormat": "Waiting (keepalive)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nginx_connections_reading",
          "legendFormat": "Reading",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nginx_connections_writing",
          "legendFormat": "Writing",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "id": 101,
      "title": "🐘 PostgreSQL — Activity & Performance",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 60 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 90 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Active DB Connections",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "pg_stat_activity_count{datname=\"perfobs\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Connections",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 10, "x": 4, "y": 8 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "PostgreSQL Transactions/s",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{datname=\"perfobs\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Commits/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{datname=\"perfobs\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Rollbacks/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 8 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "PostgreSQL Cache Hit Ratio",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{datname=\"perfobs\"}[1m]) / (rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{datname=\"perfobs\"}[1m]) + rate(pg_stat_database_blks_read{datname=\"perfobs\"}[1m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Cache Hit %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 102,
      "title": "🔵 Go API — System-Level Health",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "Go API — In-Flight Requests",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "http_requests_in_flight",
          "legendFormat": "In-Flight",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "Go API — Total Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m])) by (endpoint)",
          "legendFormat": "{{endpoint}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "id": 103,
      "title": "📦 Phase 2 — /proc & eBPF Metrics (Coming Soon)",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
          "id": 9,
          "options": {
            "content": "## Phase 2 Panels\n\nThe following panels will be populated once the `/proc` exporter and eBPF exporter are deployed:\n\n- **CPU utilization per core** (stacked, by mode: user/system/idle/iowait)\n- **Memory breakdown** (MemTotal, MemFree, MemAvailable, Cached, Buffers)\n- **Disk throughput & IOPS** (from `/proc/diskstats`)\n- **Network I/O** (rx_bytes, tx_bytes per interface)\n- **Per-process CPU/mem** (Go API, Nginx, PostgreSQL PIDs)\n- **Load average** (1m, 5m, 15m)\n\nSee `requirements_specification.md` FR-2 for the full metric list.",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "title": "Phase 2 — Placeholder",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }

  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["system", "nginx", "postgres", "phase1"],
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "System Overview",
  "uid": "perf-system",
  "version": 1
}
